OL,3,GNEWSAMurder charge after death of
OL,4,Afather-of-six
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Ffollowing the death of another man in
OL,8,FSolihull at the weekend.
OL,10,FStuart Nash died following an incident
OL,11,Fin Shustoke Road on Saturday evening
OL,12,Fand Kevin Johnson, 38, of Birmingham,
OL,13,Fappeared before magistrates in Coventry
OL,14,Fon Tuesday.
OL,16,FWest Midlands Police said he was due to
OL,17,Fappear again on 24 September at
OL,18,FBirmingham Crown Court.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
